0..77 Comment "// A parameter whose type names a session type is an endpoint, as one written"
78..104 Comment "// at the session type is."
105..107 Comment "//"
108..184 Comment "// A program names its protocol once and spells it by that name at each end."
185..261 Comment "// The name may be a top-level type, a module\'s manifest component or a name"
262..276 Comment "// for either."
277..279 Comment "//"
280..354 Comment "// The lowering reads each name through to the type its definition writes,"
355..416 Comment "// and places the parameter when that type is a session type."
417..419 Comment "//"
420..435 Comment "// - see: #4703"
